Scoped maskedmerge video filter

The option table, pix_fmts list, three-pad framesync configuration (sync=1,
EXT_STOP before, EXT_INFINITY after on base, overlay and mask), size check,
eight-bit merge arithmetic, plane mask and plane copy semantics in
src/video-ops/maskedmerge.ts follow libavfilter/vf_maskedmerge.c
(maskedmerge_options, pix_fmts, MASKEDMERGE(8), config_input, config_output,
filter_slice, process_frame) and libavfilter/maskedmerge.h.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
